    <string name="intro_title">Welcome to Exif Scrubber</string>
    <string name="intro_message">Welcome! Here is how it works:\n\n1. Click <b>\'SELECT PHOTO\'</b> to pick an image from your gallery.\n2. You will see a preview of the selected image.\n3. Click <b>\'SCRUB METADATA\'</b>. The app will remove GPS data, camera info, and timestamps.\n4. The cleaned image is saved automatically to your gallery in the folder \'Pictures/ExifScrubber\'.\n\n<b>Privacy First:</b> All processing happens <b>LOKAL</b> on your device. No data is sent over the internet.\n\n<b>Open Source:</b> The code is public and can be inspected by anyone.</string>
